//ASMSMEN JOB (ACCT),'ASM SMENMAP',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=A,REGION=4096K,
//         USER=@MVS_USER@,PASSWORD=@MVS_PASSWORD@
//* Assemble the SMENMAP BMS mapset into HERC01.KICKS.V1R5M0.KIKRPL and
//* generate the COBOL DSECT copybook into COBCOPY, using the KICKS-supplied
//* KIKMAPS proc. SYSPARM=&SYSPARM is set to MAP for the executable mapset.
//JOBPROC DD DSN=HERC01.KICKSSYS.V1R5M0.PROCLIB,DISP=SHR
//MAP     EXEC KIKMAPS,MAPNAME=SMENMAP
//
